Do not use less than 24-gauge material in humid locations or project locations 
with Environmental Severity Classifications (ESC) of C3 thru C5.  Humid locations 
are those in ASHRAE climate zones 0A, 1A, 2A, 3A, 3C, 4C and 5C (as identified 
in ASHRAE 90.1).   See UFC 1-200-01 for determination of ESC for project locations.</NPR><BRK/>
