the material is plumb and true, and within the tolerances listed:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
[<OLI>Galvanized/Galvannealed steel sheet conforming to <RID>ASTM A123/A123M</RID>, <RID>ASTM A653/A653M</RID>, <RID>ASTM A792/A792M</RID>, 
